{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic推出一系列工具，進一步將人工智能（AI）融入日常辦公，與微軟和谷歌展開更直接的競爭。這些功能將於周二Anthropic的一場活動上發佈，包括視頻通話助手、數據儀錶板工具，以及名為Claude Sheets的電子表格服務。Claude Sheets與微軟Excel和谷歌Sheets非常相似，但內置Anthropic的AI功能。許多新工具將以測試版形式向付費用户開放。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585844.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:27:23.062666+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:12:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_hash":"77b623107e47535c59a3891ef3f689b94dc8fffb048dae1b02f341f7e00330f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}